    // %s 通过了你的导出申请：%s\n任务已进入队列,完成后会再通知你。
    mb89602f1: '{0} approved your export request: {1}\nThe task is queued; you will be notified when it finishes.',
    // %s 通过了你的执行窗口申请：%s\n窗口已生效,到点自动开启、到点自动关闭。
    mdd5398c3: '{0} approved your execution window request: {1}\nThe window is active and opens and closes on schedule.',
    // %s 通过了发布单里的这一步：%s\n流水线将继续执行,无需手动操作。
    m99456d1f: '{0} approved this step of the release: {1}\nThe pipeline will continue; no action needed.',
