    // %s必须是 https —— 网关要把用户的 SSO token 发过去,明文传输等于把会话交给内网任何一台机器
    m2d58b3a9: '{0} must use https: the gateway sends the user\'s SSO token there, and plain HTTP hands the session to any machine on the internal network',
